  "translation": "O bɛɛ banna kɔ, Israyel mɔgɔw minnu tun bɛ Yuda (Yuda) duguw la, u bɔra, u ye kaba-jɔlenw wuruku, a ye Ashera jiw i tuguni, u ye ⟨את⟩ sanfɛ-yɔrɔw ni ⟨את⟩ sarakabɔlanw bila Yuda ni Binyamin ni Efrayim ni Menashe fɛɛrɛ bɛɛ la, fo u ma bɛn. O kɔ, Israyel-denw bɛɛ u seginra, mɔgɔ kelen-kelen a ka ɲɛsigiyɔrɔ la, u duguw la.",
